#.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Node (字体子集化工具)
tool/node_modules/

# 子集字体为构建产物，由 build.ps1 自动生成
assets/fonts/

# CI 下载的源字体缓存（不进仓库）
tool/.fonts/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Flutter Web 无法打包 git 子模块目录，内容由 tool/sync-content.mjs 物化到此目录
assets/content_effective/
.vercel
.env*
